<h2>How do I keep it safe?</h2>
<p><strong>Use official summaries to prepare questions for a clinician or pharmacist:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/ashwagandha">NCCIH on ashwagandha</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/rhodiola">NCCIH on rhodiola</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Magnesium-Consumer/">NIH on magnesium</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Bring the exact label and your list of medicines.</p>
<p><strong>Don't assume products are safe together</strong> just because each one is sold on its own.</p>
<p>We have removed our earlier supplement ranking, general dosing "stack" and promised timelines. They weren't justified as advice for individual readers.</p>

