<h2>Can Cortisol+ test whether a supplement worked?</h2>
<p><strong>No.</strong> The app does not measure cortisol and has no proven way to test a supplement's effect.</p>
<p>A change in heart rate variability (HRV), sleep or the wellness score can't single out what a product did. The <a href="/how-it-works/">methodology</a> explains what the score uses.</p>
<p>Medical testing and treatment decisions need their own reasons.</p>

